{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/33024fc1428918f69ee838b84438047b.poster.avif?t=1760634323\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/33024fc1428918f69ee838b84438047b.webm?t=1760634323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/33024fc1428918f69ee838b84438047b.mp4?t=1760634323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kallbrand is a first-person horror game following a separated team in a winter wilderness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1982. You are playing as a radio operator that has been sent out with your team to the Swedish wilderness to get an illegal radio tower operational. When your team becomes separated you must make your way to the tower. You are cold, isolated and\u00a0<i>something</i>\u00a0is hunting you. Use the walkie talkie to talk with a teammate and try to make out the events that lead to you being in this situation. Will you and your team make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/07de73db326a0d5fbb2c36a333be7def.poster.avif?t=1760634323\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/07de73db326a0d5fbb2c36a333be7def.webm?t=1760634323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/07de73db326a0d5fbb2c36a333be7def.mp4?t=1760634323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the hauntingly beautiful wilderness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the wilds as you weather isolation, hypothermia and looming death. You are isolated, but not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a creature out there.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/fe73a9fad7fbe4ab2b6d8718a923b82b.poster.avif?t=1760634323\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/fe73a9fad7fbe4ab2b6d8718a923b82b.webm?t=1760634323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/fe73a9fad7fbe4ab2b6d8718a923b82b.mp4?t=1760634323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavange for supplies, stay warm and stay hidden. Most important of all: stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/fdb646f87541f6929a1c3d5b4977f795.poster.avif?t=1760634323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/fdb646f87541f6929a1c3d5b4977f795.webm?t=1760634323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045850/extras/fdb646f87541f6929a1c3d5b4977f795.mp4?t=1760634323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Figure out what happened</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore what occured fourty years ago in the abandoned valley. Can you uncover the events that led up to this, before it is too late?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045850?t=176063432